    "sentences": [
      {
        "en": "I live in Hualien, a beautiful town on the east coast of Taiwan.",
        "zh": "我住在花蓮，那是台灣東部海岸的一個美麗城鎮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My life is busy but I like to stay healthy and take medicine when I am sick.",
        "zh": "我的生活很忙碌，但我喜歡保持健康，生病時會吃藥。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Every weekend my family goes to the public market where there is a big sale of fresh fruit.",
        "zh": "每個週末，我的家人會去公共市場，那裡有新鮮水果的大特賣。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We often travel by car or bus to visit relatives in other cities.",
        "zh": "我們常常開車或搭公車去拜訪其他城市的親戚。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I ride my bicycle to school, my sister likes her scooter, and my brother rides his motorcycle.",
        "zh": "我騎腳踏車上學，我姐姐喜歡她的輕型機車，我哥哥則騎重型機車。"
      },
      {
        "en": "When we go to the beach, we see many boats and a big ship that brings goods from America and China.",
        "zh": "我們去海灘時，會看到很多小船和一艘載運美國和中國貨物的大船。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If we need to go far, we can take the train or a taxi to the airport.",
        "zh": "如果我們需要遠行，可以搭火車或計程車去機場。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Trucks carry medicine and food across the island, helping everyone stay well.",
        "zh": "卡車運送藥物和食物遍布全島，幫助大家保持健康。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I dream of seeing the whole world one day, learning about different cultures and languages.",
        "zh": "我夢想有一天能看到整個世界，學習不同的文化和語言。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Learning English helps me talk to friends from other countries and share my town’s stories.",
        "zh": "學習英語讓我能夠與其他國家的朋友交談，並分享我家鄉的故事。"
      }
    ]
  },
